<fw type="header" place="top">III. Die Volksbetriebsamkeit.</fw>
<p xml:id="p212-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0224-l1"/>Das Verhältnis der Hauptberufsklassen zur Gesamtbevölkerung ist:</p>
<table xml:id="p212-b2" facs="#f0224-b2" rows="13" cols="13"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Landestheile.</cell><cell role="label">Land- u. Forstwirthschaft.</cell><cell role="label">Bergbau.</cell><cell role="label">Industrie.</cell><cell role="label">Handel.</cell><cell role="label">Transportgewerbe.</cell><cell role="label">Handarbeiter u. Taglöhner.</cell><cell role="label">Pfarrer und Lehrer.</cell><cell role="label">Beamte und Angestellte.</cell><cell role="label">Militär.</cell><cell role="label">In Wissenschaft u. Kunst Thätige.</cell><cell role="label">Pensionärs und Rentiers.</cell><cell role="label">Personen ohne Berufsausüb. ohne Berufsangbe.</cell></row><row><cell>Städte</cell><cell>2,04</cell><cell>0,01</cell><cell>65,82</cell><cell>8,10</cell><cell>0,72</cell><cell>6,07</cell><cell>1,77</cell><cell>5,03</cell><cell>3,03</cell><cell>2,49</cell><cell>2,69</cell><cell>0,65 1,58</cell></row><row><cell>Plattland</cell><cell>28,15</cell><cell>0,04</cell><cell>37,23</cell><cell>3,87</cell><cell>0,30</cell><cell>20,55</cell><cell>0,98</cell><cell>2,66</cell><cell>0,08</cell><cell>0,24</cell><cell>4,09</cell><cell>— 1,81</cell></row><row><cell>Landesth. <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName></cell><cell>17,25</cell><cell>0,03</cell><cell>49,17</cell><cell>5,64</cell><cell>0,47</cell><cell>14,50</cell><cell>1,31</cell><cell>3,65</cell><cell>1,31</cell><cell>1,18</cell><cell>3,51</cell><cell>0,27 1,71</cell></row><row><cell>Städte</cell><cell>2,75</cell><cell>1,73</cell><cell>64,77</cell><cell>6,47</cell><cell>1,07</cell><cell>6,65</cell><cell>1,57</cell><cell>7,56</cell><cell>0,05</cell><cell>2,74</cell><cell>2,86</cell><cell>0,32 1,46</cell></row><row><cell>Plattland</cell><cell>30,14</cell><cell>0,29</cell><cell>51,21</cell><cell>2,30</cell><cell>0,12</cell><cell>9,86</cell><cell>1,17</cell><cell>1,08</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>0,19</cell><cell>2,56</cell><cell>0,01 1,07</cell></row><row><cell>Landesth. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</pla